'' 'obj.R = v' over a BYREF method that needs no argument calls it and stores through what it
'' returns -- through '.', '->', '+=', a 'with', an all-default parameter -- and '@g.R' is the
'' referent's address; a property setter and 'T.SF = v' / 'ns.NF = v' inside their own
'' function are unchanged. tiko stored through R's code address and segfaulted, and '@g.R'
'' was R's code. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/method-assign-byref.bas -o tests/codegen/methodassignbyref.exe
